{
  "_about": [
    "The tenant configuration the Sales Orders screen runs under — the QA store's, as the production",
    "app received it on 25 Sep 2026 (/v2/multiAdmin/setup). Only the keys this screen reads are kept;",
    "every credential, key, contact and real location in the original was removed.",
    "Each flag changes what renders. Flip one here to see the tenant variant it produces:",
    "  orderManagementFeatures.*   toolbar buttons and the Allocation Status column",
    "  googleSheet.view/edit       the Google Sheet toolbar and the mobile Export/History buttons",
    "  showOrderInvoiceAction      the Invoice column",
    "  orderWorkflow               status options per row, which rows can be invoiced and edited",
    "  storefrontMenus             the label the screen calls itself ('Sales Orders')"
  ],
